    "bodyPreview": "ProposalPal\nInstructions & Support\n\nLearn more about the proposal process and how to get product help\n\nFAQ\nSupport\nOverview\nWhat is ProposalPal?\nWhat can ProposalPal do?\nGenerate proposal outlines and content using AI assistance\nManage team collaboration and assign roles to team members\nResearch client information and competitive insights automatically\nCreate commercial approaches and pricing structures\nPolish and refine proposal language for maximum impact\nExport proposals in multiple formats (PDF, DOCX, PowerPoint)\nAccess\nWho can access ProposalPal?\nI can't find my team member\nI can't open ProposalPal on my phone?\nProposalPal is optimized for desktop and tablet use. While mobile viewing is supported, full editing capabilities work best on larger screens. For mobile access issues, ensure you're using a supported browser (Chrome, Safari, or Edge).\nCreating a new proposal\nHow can I create a new proposal?\nHow can I find a proposal my team created?\nAll proposals you're invited to will appear on your home page. You can also use the search bar to find proposals by client name, opportunity ID, or team member.\nWhere can I find an old proposal?\nCan I upload more documents later?\nSecurity & Privacy\nHow is confidential data handled?"
  },
